course-data.js

# The commercial module. Proprietary, and this repository is GPL-3.0 — so it is
# ignored here rather than merely untracked, because the cost of one absent-minded
# `git add -A` is publishing code that was never meant to be distributed.
#
# It is a submodule (see .gitmodules), and `git submodule add` refuses an ignored
# path, which is why it was added with --force. Keeping the entry after the fact
# is deliberate: the gitlink is tracked regardless, so this only ever stops the
# submodule's *contents* being added to this repository by accident.
/pro/